1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:03,820
Our topic is campus dogs.

2
00:00:04,360 --> 00:00:08,040
So we just want to know what's your opinion on the conditions of campus dogs?

3
00:00:08,360 --> 00:00:09,700
What should be done with them?

4
00:00:11,920 --> 00:00:18,160
I don't have much interaction on a daily basis because

5
00:00:18,160 --> 00:00:20,560
I don't feed them either

6
00:00:20,560 --> 00:00:25,380
The main thing happens when you are sitting at the exit of the canteen

7
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:50,280
You must have heard something, you must be scared of dogs.

8
00:00:52,040 --> 00:00:56,840
I didn't bite them but it wasn't an injury.

9
00:00:58,160 --> 00:00:59,840
They ran away with my shoes.

10
00:01:01,360 --> 00:01:05,040
We had kept our shoes outside so they were found in B block.

11
00:01:22,460 --> 00:01:24,140
What are the problems that dogs face?

12
00:01:39,680 --> 00:01:41,520
Send them to feeding zone.

13
00:01:43,500 --> 00:01:48,620
Do you think if we make designated shelters for dogs, is that a better solution?

14
00:01:49,020 --> 00:01:50,880
They should be allowed outside the hostel only.

15
00:01:52,800 --> 00:01:54,660
Shelters other than feeding zones?

16
00:01:57,140 --> 00:01:59,620
Shelter also will not be possible.

17
00:02:00,800 --> 00:02:02,380
Dog lovers will come.

18
00:02:03,780 --> 00:02:06,300
Why should I keep them in shelters?

19
00:02:08,540 --> 00:02:10,440
That's not possible.

20
00:02:11,600 --> 00:02:14,920
So, if you are against MNC, then I am also against it.

21
00:02:16,140 --> 00:02:17,260
Because this should not happen.

22
00:02:17,740 --> 00:02:22,760
But if MNC has a big group of dogs, in front of the SAC, they attack someone suddenly.

23
00:02:24,180 --> 00:02:25,360
Where do you stand?

24
00:02:25,640 --> 00:02:30,120
Do you think that those who fear dogs are fair and those who take care of them are fair?

25
00:02:30,280 --> 00:02:30,880
What is your opinion?

26
00:02:33,420 --> 00:02:34,540
I just...

27
00:02:34,540 --> 00:02:35,060
Neutral

28
00:02:37,060 --> 00:02:42,780
I am neutral but I think that if a dog enters the campus, it won't bite.

29
00:02:43,760 --> 00:02:50,360
If something happens, like a guard or someone grabs him, then I will leave peacefully.

30
00:02:51,820 --> 00:02:57,240
Yes, but accidents happen with people and they are bitten on campus.

31
00:02:57,240 --> 00:03:04,420
I think dogs should be kept vaccinated.

32
00:03:06,340 --> 00:03:08,540
Yes, that is a basic thing.

33
00:03:10,460 --> 00:03:13,140
Are you aware of the CCFK campus committee?

34
00:03:13,620 --> 00:03:17,320
Do you know if there's anything that exists on campus to keep dogs safe?

35
00:03:19,220 --> 00:03:20,820
I didn't know about it until few days ago.

36
00:03:20,820 --> 00:03:24,540
I didn't know that.

37
00:03:24,960 --> 00:03:27,060
Thank you.

